// Smallest winning labeled hamming among the kept pairs.
// No pair returns nothing. A winning hamming of zero stays zero.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hmin ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hmin rank

IMPULSE hmin 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hmin" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
